  know:'You need one blown-up balloon and a little clear space. Everyone who can reach the balloon can play — no teams, no turns, just keep it up.',
  why:'A balloon falls slowly, so young players can watch it coming and choose their tap. It is the gentlest catching-and-hitting game ever invented.',
